# Quantum-L9 Python Museum — l9-observability-core

> This file is generated from .cursor/rules/templates/*.mdc.template. Do not edit directly; edit the template or plugin-config.yaml.

## Identity

- This repo is a **non-Constellation** Quantum-L9 Python package/service.
- Constellation **nodes** → use [L9-Node-Template](https://github.com/Quantum-L9/L9-Node-Template).
- `constellation_*` **deps** → use [Constellation.PackageTemplate](https://github.com/Quantum-L9/Constellation.PackageTemplate).

## Forbidden (wrong product)

- `create_node_app`, Gate handlers, `register_handler`, TransportPacket routing as product law
- `enginehandlers.py`, `nodespec.yaml`, `contracts/`, Justfile
- Peer-node HTTP dispatch patterns that belong only in node/SDK repos
